{"title":"1997 OIM Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/c/08c752684aa7b9a6761e7b3c8e82ec6f5e9509a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{P}  = {P_1, P_2, \\cdots , P_{1997}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"168\" height=\"18\" /> be a set of 1997 points inside a circle of radius 1, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b0256a78d58b6d5f7a53400b19e7747d2983fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"17\" /> being the center of the circle. For each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/a/25ad0d4317fab9e033f42c0676566a074a56f7fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 1, \\cdots , 1997$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"125\" height=\"18\" /> let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/d/f5d3dead9cb8d5f6327c737e014850be7a29d0f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" /> be the distance from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/e/76ebaba4ae3d5c911d6e31ad855d502ad88d48a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"18\" height=\"15\" /> to the point of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/4/5c43a55d849ab9a1612462c849e5baa23928a6c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{P}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"13\" /> closest to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/e/76ebaba4ae3d5c911d6e31ad855d502ad88d48a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"18\" height=\"15\" /> and different from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/e/76ebaba4ae3d5c911d6e31ad855d502ad88d48a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"18\" height=\"15\" />. Show that\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/7/d073e37edb14bff92b025b159a8d973da115e443.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x_1)^2 + (x_2)^2 + \\cdots + (x_{1997})^2 \\le 9\\]\" width=\"257\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>~translated into English by Tomas Diaz. ~orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1997_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.oma.org.ar/enunciados/ibe12.htm\">https://www.oma.org.ar/enunciados/ibe12.htm</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017072512\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 61/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 423/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1648/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.670      1 Template:Solution\n100.00%    5.670      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26114:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017072512 and revision id 208422. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}